## Production

```bash
npm run build                     # writes static/dist
python manage.py collectstatic    # copies static/dist -> staticfiles
```

Set `DEBUG=False` and a real `ALLOWED_HOSTS` in `.env`. Static files are served by WhiteNoise; run the app under Gunicorn:

```bash
gunicorn {{ project_name }}.wsgi
```
